# Gate step — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq). Moved from an inline build.sh
# --check block by the .step series (batch 5: the next slowest movable blocks,
# lenovinha timing log 2026-11-24).
#
# Order 721-nyev. Every script that RUNS tillandsias-plan must resolve it
# through the shared probe, never a hardcoded target/ path. 704-zcgi
# centralised that probe on the reasoning that fixing instances is not
# enough, and four more instances appeared afterwards anyway — each written
# by someone with no reason to know the probe existed. This makes the rule
# enforceable rather than remembered.
STEP_DESC="Checking plan-binary resolution goes through the shared probe (721-nyev)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/check-plan-binary-probe-usage.sh"
STEP_ERROR="a script runs tillandsias-plan from a hardcoded target/ path — an executable bit is a claim, running the binary is evidence"
STEP_OK="Plan-binary probe usage check passed"
STEP_READS="scripts/check-plan-binary-probe-usage.sh"
